    "introduction": "Arnolds Burovs(1915-2006)拉脱维亚动画大师，主要从事偶动画制作。Arnolds Burovs是拉脱维亚动画史上一位非常重要的动画人，也被称为拉脱维亚偶动画的创始人。Arnolds Burovs在从事动画工作之前是从事木偶剧制作且那是已经凭借木偶剧获得过国际大奖。Arnolds Burovs was born on 29 April 1915 in Riga, Governorate of Livonia, Russian Empire [now Latvia]. He was a director and writer, known for Sapnis (1983), Princese un puma (1986) and Bimini (1981). He died on 13 January 2006 in Riga, Latvia.BornApril 29, 1915DiedJanuary 13, 2006(90)",
